WEBVTT

00:00:09.948 --> 00:00:11.948
I'm flying to Yabusha!

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.380
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:00:19.804 --> 00:00:20.304
Let's go!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.800
This falcon is very affectionate.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.740
Yes, it's a very loyal animal.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.760
Of course, it's very grateful because...

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.580
When he was injured he couldn't fly anymore.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:50.180
I'll make him become the first Japanese falcon!

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:53.830
Unfortunately there's no wild wolf here because they've destroyed the trees.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:11.000
It's a shame that poor birds end up devoured by falcons.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.000
But it's natural.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.830
It's natural, but I don't think it's fair.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.250
I don't even want to say it as a joke.

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:20.450
To survive, the falcons need to feed on small animals,

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.290
like little birds, birds and kitties.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.470
It's a law of nature.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:28.010
Since there are no birds, let's do this!

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:28.650
Go!

00:01:41.068 --> 00:01:43.388
I continue to go down the trees, damn it!

00:02:11.068 --> 00:02:12.588
The sky is black with bats.

00:02:13.148 --> 00:02:15.148
Keep going, keep going!

00:02:30.252 --> 00:02:30.752
FOR TRUTH!

00:02:30.764 --> 00:02:34.264
Even in these conditions I can't continue to train him.

00:02:34.264 --> 00:02:36.264
Let's go back home, Jenkis!

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:16.250
Attention! They're really impressive!

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.430
There must be thousands of them.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:20.840
We have to get rid of them as soon as possible,

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.980
so that they don't hinder the launch of the devices.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:34.650
This is Shidon Demo speaking.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:40.780
As you can see, a lot of firecrackers have built a nest in the mouths of the Jettas.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.500
It's fantastic.

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:47.610
The situation we managed to determine will create a big problem in the Sao Tome laboratory.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:53.200
In fact, it was the premise of the plan that you had devised that from now on could have a beginning.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:56.090
Emperor Brahe, there is nothing left but his approval.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:59.780
And we can thus affirm that the end of the Sao Tome laboratory...

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:03.300
and thus the triumph of the Kingdom of the Hundred Devils.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:06.300
I've been waiting for this good news for a long time.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:08.200
Now I want to show you something.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:12.770
It concerns the originality of your plan?

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:16.170
Its peculiarity lies precisely in this mechanical pipistrello

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.470
that I have scrupulously experimented.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:19.830
We are anxious to hear it.

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:22.530
The head of the mechanical pipistrello has been formed

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:26.570
of a special electric wave and other pipistrello.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.980
Now, if their Lordships grant it to me, I will give it a...

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:30.580
Demonstration.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:33.880
Where are you going?

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:21.780
Follow the second phase, the bomb has a huge destructive power, its antenna is so sensitive that a minimum of touch is not enough to prove it.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.840
With this murderous horde I will attack...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.310
in the laboratory of Sao Tome and thus you will witness its disappearance from the face of the Earth!

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:37.880
Which, for too long, is our sole purpose.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:59.850
It is exaggerated to feed the falco of the steak of life.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.900
Isn't it better that we eat them?

00:06:02.180 --> 00:06:08.220
For you they would be completely wasted, while for the falcons it is necessary to feed only on very tender meat.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:12.200
Good, we were waiting for you.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:14.680
Mama prepared them, they are delicious.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:16.440
It will certainly be as you say.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:17.200
I think so too.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:23.500
How come there are only potatoes here?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.360
I'm sorry, but you have to be content.

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.660
Well taken all the meat that was there.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:28.740
It's a beautiful prepotent.

00:06:39.276 --> 00:06:42.636
The Pipistrelli have completely invaded the Sao Tome laboratory!

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:46.080
Immediately start the second phase of the operation!

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.540
The bastards have invaded the lab again!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.300
Get out!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:14.810
What do you say? A pipistrello-shaped bomb?

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.240
Incredible! Don't lose your cool! We'll be there immediately!

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:23.940
All bombs!

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:26.490
Don't be silly! You'll see how I kick them out!

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.770
Stop! If they're bombs, they can explode at the slightest touch!

00:07:33.804 --> 00:07:36.804
In fact, only one of the demons can have done such a thing.

00:07:36.804 --> 00:07:37.804
Damn it!

00:07:38.636 --> 00:07:40.636
How can we defend ourselves from all this?

00:07:41.132 --> 00:07:44.132
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:11.460
Perfect. Magnificent show. We count on you, Shidon Demon.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:16.780
We'll watch the end of the famous laboratory in South Omeha.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.120
The radar signals the approach of an enemy robot!

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:20.470
We're waiting. Let's activate the robot jet without wasting any more time!

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:21.260
I agree!

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:23.120
Oh, Sion...

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.200
Ryo, what's happening to you?

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:29.970
Do you realize we can't move if we don't hunt all the...

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.900
These are the type of pistols that destroy the launchers.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:39.810
I'm in control. Retreat immediately underground.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:54.300
The robots are equipped with electromagnetic waves

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:57.100
that have the power to section any solid material.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.520
Proceed immediately to attack.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:06.550
I want to stay inert, I want to fight!

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:08.590
You already know it's not possible.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.350
But the laboratory will be destroyed.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:14.040
Unfortunately, we are in a truly tragic situation.

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:20.520
We must first find a way to make these pipistrello-shaped bombs inoffensive.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:29.490
Get that robot out of the way!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.440
It's a robot that shows to be good at nothing!

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:32.940
This metal is more tenacious than expected.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.540
It will be a special league.

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:38.380
It's not the time to look for excuses.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.500
Think rather to solve the situation!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.750
Stay calm and listen to me.

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.090
The robot will first attack the houses of the city,

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.250
then we will think about the rest.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:49.990
When part of the population will be hit,

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.270
we will surely force the robot jet

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:53.330
to get out of its den,

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.210
despite the popcorn bombs.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:57.230
I understand, the idea is great.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:59.960
And it's the safest way to reach...

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:01.100
To destroy our intent.

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:10.130
He will have renounced to destroy the laboratory.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:21.940
The city!

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:23.820
Curse! It's a real tragedy!

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:48.320
What else to make exist inert to that mess? I do not do it!

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:49.060
Do not move!

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:52.440
That the mouths of Lancio are covered with pipistrelli?

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.880
It is impossible to start the devices Jetta!

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.400
Accidents to pipistrelli!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.680
I've got a great idea to get them out of there!

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.680
You say to send the falcon there?

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.950
I don't know why.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:09.850
All right, you'll tell me later, as soon as we'll see each other.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.100
Get the robot!

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:15.060
You're such a coward!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:19.560
You stay there and watch, don't you hear the cries of the help of your people?

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:22.250
The Pipistrello bombs scare you so much?

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:24.350
Get the robot!

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:27.650
You're the most cowardly person on Earth!

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:35.870
What are you talking about, you stupid?

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:47.000
You savage, kick him out!

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:21.700
And I say to Lancio that...

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.070
They'll find out what awaits them!

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:35.610
As soon as the show is over, we'll be able to leave with the jets!

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.050
Let's hope you don't get lost, I can't wait!

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:12.240
The Pistelli are coming back!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.120
Don't worry, Ayamusha knows what he's doing!

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:51.890
Now it's just impossible to leave!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:54.620
Now you are served!

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.290
How they tried to kill my dear Yabush!

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:59.430
No one can imagine how much he loved him!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.160
Professor, we are waiting for orders from you.

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:06.530
Fortunately, only the outer part of the launch caps has been hit.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:11.870
But since we only have time to provide some summary repairs, you will also try the departure.

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.470
It all depends on your pilot skills.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.580
And don't worry, Professor, we will do our best.

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:22.420
The first part of our plan is completed and we have made the robot jet unusable.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:26.760
Now it's the turn of the Sao Tome laboratory. Let's head for it.

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:37.210
Oh, my God! The Shido-Robo is coming back from this side!

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.050
I can try to make time with Lady Command!

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:42.810
It's too dangerous, Mikiru! You can't do it alone!

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:47.900
There's no other way to stop it! I'll go myself!

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:52.490
Damn it! Why are they taking so long?

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.150
A little patience! Try to stay calm!

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:59.050
How can I stay calm when I can't wait to avenge my Falco?

00:15:59.310 --> 00:15:59.710
You're right!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.160
It's just a matter of waiting a bit.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:09.530
No, Eru!

00:16:46.828 --> 00:16:49.428
We can hope that Lady Coman will do it on her own.

00:16:49.428 --> 00:16:51.428
Where are you with the repairs?

00:16:51.428 --> 00:16:54.028
They're over now. We've done our best.

00:16:54.028 --> 00:16:57.228
The success of the take-off will depend only on the ability of the three pilots.

00:16:57.676 --> 00:16:59.576
Ready for take off! Confirm!

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:00.940
Ready!

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.240
They will take care of the rest inside.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:51.790
Formation 3!

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:56.240
Open.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:05.510
Let's try to hit him by firing from three different directions!

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:06.450
I'm ready!

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:07.710
Formation open!

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:18.050
Fire at will!

00:20:52.396 --> 00:20:55.076
if my dear Ayabusha will not give you escape anymore!

00:21:11.708 --> 00:21:13.708
I have finally been able to avenge you!

00:21:13.708 --> 00:21:17.708
Every time I look at the sky, I will always see your wings free!
